#
# Verible rules for the PeakRDL-generated CSR (generated-files/), read by the
# verible engine of run-lintcrux.sh (3.build/lintcrux_build), which finds the
# .rules.verible_lint nearest to each file. As in run-lint.sh, our style rules
# do not apply to generated code, so the style rules it trips are off
-explicit-parameter-storage-type
-generate-label
-generate-label-prefix
-line-length
-no-trailing-spaces
-parameter-name-style
-struct-union-name-style
-typedef-structs-unions
-unpacked-dimensions-range-ordering
